{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0124_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fe13bae8f6146a26f348738bca309db7e2b614eabc9ec547d460bbf865119987", "ja": "（ライブの後、劇場の屋上から、杏奈と一緒に\n近くで行われていた打ち上げ花火を見た）", "zh": "（演唱会之后，我跟杏奈一起\n在剧场屋顶欣赏了附近举办的烟火秀。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0124_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "89caf6ef7d45be86aab0140c62b178363e2ca7646657c21ebc3963c4a3e6ae77", "ja": "{$P$}さん、花火キレイだったね！\nキラキラしてて、最高だった！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，烟火好漂亮喔！\n闪闪发光的，真是美极了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0124_1002_p", "source_sha256": "9de3527f6442699f2de8975d86641a5225f0041a70372f67ded0be2bcada83dc", "ja": "ああ、綺麗だったな。それより杏奈、大丈夫か？\nステージが終わってすぐここに来たし、疲れただろ。", "zh": "嗯，很漂亮呢。倒是杏奈你还好吗？\n表演一结束就马上过来这里，应该累了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0124_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "d378b3e12fe73c050b7f052568225f98a8692782ec3d18284f416f64b4917db4", "ja": "ううん！　杏奈、全然疲れてないよ！\nもう1回、ステージに出られちゃいそうなくらい！", "zh": "不会！杏奈一点都不累！\n甚至可以再登台表演一次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0124_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "dbec28efd77cd2e4de2d80f15b8cd48f2aefc9b51f8e2df50f0dee53fc25f053", "ja": "ほら、こーんなに元気……あれ？", "zh": "你看，杏奈这～么有精神……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0124_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f32addcb70cb7e600158f172b6449e7981ab5a71348fab8d0c72c465e46fd430", "ja": "とか言って、足元がフラフラしてるじゃないか。\n無理は禁物だからな！", "zh": "嘴上这么说，结果你都站不稳了。\n不可以硬撑喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0124_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "b0714b38c86a0fe6ca5fbb0100a7f11234650d27cad051a1feca307700d5ee2a", "ja": "うぅ、ごめんなさい……。\nちょっと、休憩……。", "zh": "呜呜，对不起……\n杏奈休息一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0124_1007_p", "source_sha256": "07f05e6e9ff0cdc104385543ca2b0d480719da03cdbe30be0885a48ed664254d", "ja": "ステージの後だから仕方ないよ。それより杏奈、\n今日は昼間からずっと元気だな。お祭り楽しかったか？", "zh": "才刚表演完，会累是难免的。先不说这个，\n杏奈你今天从白天就一直很有精神呢，祭典开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0124_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "435fbee0382b9807c9a54b7952cd16e270ea3f92df6370fb1ee11dba969d3c28", "ja": "うん！　あのね、お祭り会場で、レアアイテムが\n見つかって……レアな敵も、いっぱいいたんだよ！", "zh": "嗯！跟你说，杏奈在祭典会场找到了稀有道具……\n然后还有好多稀有敌人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0124_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "b29b3ce83aa87961e4ab8da4486c885e78fb0ae337ce6d68b07fd4b92172fedb", "ja": "杏奈、いつもは人混みとか疲れちゃうんだけど。\n今日はロコと、ずーっとお祭り会場にいたんだ♪", "zh": "平常人挤人都会让杏奈很累，\n不过杏奈今天跟ROCO一～直待在祭典会场喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0124_1010_p", "source_sha256": "566717451f36817c7d2462e32d570a6dfc26ae796e7c7b504b9ff5ec65ddc86f", "ja": "へえ、そうだったのか。でもゲームだけで、\nお祭りは見て回らなかったのか？", "zh": "哦，原来是这样啊。\n但你只有玩游戏，没有逛祭典吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0124_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "a00e07f6e6eca812796e7bad2ff9261a22ec8c48e5ada22668c051e6b8b34559", "ja": "ううん、お祭りもちゃんと見て回ったよ！\nロコと一緒に、かき氷買って食べたの！", "zh": "没啦，杏奈有把祭典好好逛一圈喔！\n还跟ROCO一起买了刨冰吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0124_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "238f227bc0f0a6ea1ee5491143e009ccee3b53c46f401050f3f49b645deb2cb9", "ja": "杏奈、夏祭りの思い出とか、全然ないから……\nうれしかったし、すっごく楽しかった！", "zh": "因为杏奈不曾有过夏日祭典的回忆……\n所以真的很高兴，也很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0124_1013_p", "source_sha256": "966a1d87a3bac79926b693b005a5f01c4cc514707f7f9cb55ed3aed71f49a3fc", "ja": "そうか。\nいい思い出ができて、よかったな。", "zh": "这样啊。\n能留下一段美好的回忆，太好了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0124_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "954563b76b2ed15b10ba6167b97272070876deb3e81abd86f19cafd61c201077", "ja": "うん！　……でもライブが成功したのが、\n一番うれしかったかも！", "zh": "嗯！……不过杏奈最高兴的，\n应该还是演唱会很成功！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0124_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "90eb0e76f771266097917840cd1634ef462670ef113a0e60977f6b73c8ccde0b", "ja": "ファンのみんなが、杏奈のライブを見てて。\n杏奈、みんなに楽しくなってほしいって思ったんだ。", "zh": "粉丝们在台下看着杏奈的演唱会，\n杏奈就希望大家都可以开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0124_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "f60c6573f05ba86e2f0646b9fd5f3dfe394c116991c0a05020c6052dd4358609", "ja": "杏奈が、いっぱいいっぱい経験値を上げたら……\nファンのみんなは、もっともっと、楽しくなるかな？", "zh": "等杏奈提升了很多很多经验值……\n粉丝们会不会更加更加开心呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0124_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5022b76ea6d1b5848c64fbf324083c439a513dd0a7e07d6084509a63dad594ad", "ja": "うん、そうだな。きっとファンのみんなも、\n杏奈も、楽しくなるんじゃないかと思うよ。", "zh": "嗯，是啊，我想粉丝们和杏奈，\n肯定都会变得更开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0124_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "abdecddd3fd1bbf846c28f914e2e682ddfd876118e5c248b955a9a1cc5415fe6", "ja": "ファンのみんなも、杏奈も……。えへへ。\nあのね、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "粉丝们和杏奈都……嘿嘿。\n那个，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0124_1019_024ann", "source_sha256": "331c782506da73e5bde7f152c587c3186fcd6affdfa184aba46862249128b876", "ja": "今日みたいに、{$P$}さんと一緒なら\n……杏奈、もっとレベルアップできると思うんだ。", "zh": "只要像今天一样和{$P$}先生一起……\n杏奈觉得自己就可以提升更多等级。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0124_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "270b43fd0f2ef3c2d5012bf1e3a6f2ec2da21c5a54849165ef05ebb400374625", "ja": "だから、これからも……\nずっとずっと、杏奈のそばにいてね！　約束っ♪", "zh": "所以，今后你也要……\n一直一直陪在杏奈身边喔！一言为定♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
